{
  "date": "2025-06-23",
  "messages": [
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "머해!!!",
      "en": "What are you doing!!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "베트남에서 돌아와따",
      "en": "I just got back from Vietnam."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "베트남 공연",
      "en": "The performance in Vietnam..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "진짜 너무 좋았어",
      "en": "It was seriously so amazing."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "너무 영광스러운 무대였어…",
      "en": "It was such an honor to perform there..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "비 맞으면서 했는데",
      "en": "We performed in the rain,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "진짜 낭만이였어",
      "en": "and it honestly felt so romantic."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "감기가 걸리긴 했는데",
      "en": "I did catch a cold,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "한국 오니까 괜찮아졌엉",
      "en": "but once I got back to Korea, I got better."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "베트남 갔으니까",
      "en": "Since I was in Vietnam,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "쌀국수 먹어야지 하고",
      "en": "I thought I had to eat pho."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "저녁에 시켜먹고",
      "en": "So I ordered it for dinner,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아침에 공항가기 전에도 급하게",
      "en": "and before heading to the airport the next morning,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "시켜놓고",
      "en": "I ordered it again,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "픽업 전까지 막 먹음",
      "en": "and hurriedly ate it before my pickup arrived."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아니 그리구 어제 저녁에",
      "en": "Oh, and last night..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "망고가 너무 먹고싶어서",
      "en": "I was really craving mango."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "망고 앤 용과 포도 플리즈",
      "en": "\"Mango, dragon fruit, and grapes, please.\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "해서",
      "en": "So I ordered them."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "시켰는데",
      "en": "But..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "약 40분 뒤에",
      "en": "about 40 minutes later,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "노 망고",
      "en": "\"No mango.\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "품절이래",
      "en": "They said it was sold out."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "…",
      "en": "…"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그리고 나서 30분 뒤에 와서",
      "en": "Then it arrived another 30 minutes later,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "한시간 넘게 기다려서",
      "en": "so after waiting for over an hour,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "새벽에 과일 용과랑 포도만 급하게",
      "en": "I ended up hurriedly eating just the dragon fruit and grapes in the middle of the night."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "막 먹음",
      "en": "I just scarfed them down."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "용과가 베트남은",
      "en": "Dragon fruit in Vietnam"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "진짜 확실히 달아",
      "en": "is definitely sweeter."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그리고",
      "en": "Also..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "마트에선 망고 사먹었는데",
      "en": "I bought mangoes from a supermarket,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "딱딱한데",
      "en": "and even though they were firm,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "달아",
      "en": "they were sweet."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "신기했어",
      "en": "It was fascinating."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나사실",
      "en": "Honestly..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "지금 너무 배고파",
      "en": "I'm really hungry right now."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "아니 뭔가 음식보다",
      "en": "Actually, more than food..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "망고에대한 미련때문에",
      "en": "I just can't get over those mangoes."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "망고가 먹고싶어",
      "en": "I want mango."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "지금 시키면",
      "en": "Would it be weird if I ordered some now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "좀 그런가",
      "en": "Maybe I shouldn't..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "보고왔어 망고",
      "en": "I just looked up mangoes."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "하 고민좀",
      "en": "Sigh... I'll think about it."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "해볼게",
      "en": "I'll give it some thought."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "시차적응중이야? ㅋㅋㅋ",
      "en": "Are you still adjusting to the time difference? ㅋㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그런가봐",
      "en": "I guess so."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "지금 베트남은",
      "en": "It's still"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "2시간 전이니까",
      "en": "two hours earlier in Vietnam,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "배고플수….",
      "en": "so I guess..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "있지",
      "en": "it makes sense that I'm hungry."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "너 뭐해 졸려?",
      "en": "What are you doing? Are you sleepy?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "졸리기도 해",
      "en": "I'm sleepy too."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그래서 고민중",
      "en": "That's why I'm debating what to do."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "수..박 먹고싶다",
      "en": "I... kind of want some watermelon."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "수박 진쨔 시러!!",
      "en": "I reaaally hate watermelon!!"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "베트남가서",
      "en": "I tried it again"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "한입 먹어봤는데",
      "en": "while I was in Vietnam,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "다시 느꼈어",
      "en": "and it reminded me..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "와우",
      "en": "Wow."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "😅",
      "en": "😅"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "맞다",
      "en": "Oh, right."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나 배지전쟁",
      "en": "About Badge War..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅎㅎㅎㅎ",
      "en": "ㅎㅎㅎㅎ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "난 내가 주인공이 되는줄알고",
      "en": "I thought I was going to become the main character,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "정말 설레고 기쁜 마음으로 열쇠를 잡았는데",
      "en": "so I grabbed the key feeling so excited and happy."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "제가 느낀 박탈감은 말로 표현할수 없습니다….",
      "en": "The disappointment I felt can't even be put into words..."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "울었어? 너 억울하면 눈물 난다매",
      "en": "Did you cry? You said you tear up whenever you feel it's unfair."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "필사적으로 참음",
      "en": "I desperately held it back."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "여기서 내가 율면",
      "en": "If I cried there,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그림이 이상해지겠다",
      "en": "the whole picture would've been weird."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅋㄹㅋㅋㄹㅋㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㅋ",
      "en": "ㅋㄹㅋㅋㄹㅋㅋㄹㅋㄹㅋㅋ"
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "채원 신위가 그래도 너 끝까지 응원해주더라ㅠ 그렇게 배신당햇는데ㅠㅠ",
      "en": "Chaewon and Xinyu still cheered you on until the very end, even after you 'betrayed' them. ㅠㅠ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그러니까….",
      "en": "I know..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "너무 고맙다…",
      "en": "I'm so thankful..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내가 개인 시그널에서",
      "en": "In my personal SIGNAL,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "말했돈",
      "en": "when I said,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "채원 신위 고맙다 한것",
      "en": "\"Thank you, Chaewon and Xinyu,\""
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "유연언니는",
      "en": "YooYeon unnie,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나경언니의 말을듣고",
      "en": "after listening to NaKyoung unnie,"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "지연언닐 선택했지…",
      "en": "ended up choosing JiYeon unnie..."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "열쇠 구멍 찾을때 채원이 멘탈케어가 도움이 좀 되긴 했어??",
      "en": "When you were looking for the keyhole, did Chaewon's encouragement help at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "사실 안들림…",
      "en": "Honestly... I couldn't hear it."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "채연언니의 큰 목소리만",
      "en": "All I could hear"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "잘들리고",
      "en": "was Chaeyeon unnie's loud voice."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "내 멘탈을 아주 흔들어놨어",
      "en": "It completely shook my mental state."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "채원이 너 엄청 열정적으로 응원하던댕",
      "en": "Chaewon was cheering for you so passionately though."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "어그래서 좀 감동 이였음",
      "en": "Yeah, so I was actually pretty touched."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "ㅠㅠ",
      "en": "ㅠㅠ"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "채원아 고맙다",
      "en": "Chaewon, thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "fan",
      "ko": "그럼 07즈 리더 양보하나여",
      "en": "So are you giving up the title of 07z leader?"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "그건 안되지~~",
      "en": "Now that can't happen~~"
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나 좀 졸린것같앙…",
      "en": "I think I'm getting sleepy..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "망고를 포기하고 그냥 잘게…",
      "en": "I'll give up on the mangoes and just go to sleep..."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "나 잔당",
      "en": "I'm going to bed."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "잘자구",
      "en": "Sleep well."
    },
    {
      "type": "hayeon",
      "ko": "하랑해🩷",
      "en": "Haranghae🩷"
    }
  ]
}